{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id511772256"}, "name":{"label":"Devlinse"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-27T12:52:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"9127883117"}, "title":{"label":"Daily vs. weekly streak."}, "content":{"label":"Love the app, it’s simple and works really well. \n\nMy work patterns mean it’s has to maintain a daily\ntarget but I’m usually 130% or more of my weekly target (based on 11500 per day)\n\nI’d love to have the option to switch between daily and weekly targets. At times it’s a bit demotivating - I think “why bother”, when all I see is missed targets which is the opposite of what’s intended. And this is despite exceeding my week targets. \n\nMaybe there’s just something wrong with me 😂\n\nFive stars with this feature bump. But honestly it’s a great app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
