{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id564733336"}, "name":{"label":"Mwanga49"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-19T01:11:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"9099826419"}, "title":{"label":"Great monitor and motivate"}, "content":{"label":"This app has most of what you need to see how well you are doing on your daily walks and in motivating you to keep walking and even to improve on your daily walks on your own or with others. If you have issues such as diabetes or a back problems that need you to exercise daily, this app can be just what you need to encourage you to make a start and over months improve by allowing you to set and, when you feel ready, increase your own targets. The month by month challenges and other challenges add a further interest and motivation which become self fulfilling targets of their own. Have fun and a happy and healthy New Year !\nThis is as true today as it was when I first started using the app years ago.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"77"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"139"}}, 
